@copilot Update this PR directly with one scoped documentation correction.

In the newly added returned-value assignment paragraph of .github/agents/knowledge/javaagent-advice-patterns.md, remove the parenthetical "(the indy transformer)" after the TypeTransformerImpl link. The agreed naming rule gives the default path the plain name; this newly added mode label reintroduces the shorthand being removed. Also drop the redundant "(the injected-helper transformer)" label after InjectingTypeTransformerImpl, leaving both useful source links and a simple "Both ... and ... install" sentence.

Keep all class names, packages, code, advice behavior, and other documentation unchanged. Use the repository's Markdown formatting/linting runner for this changed file if applicable. This is documentation-only; do not run unrelated builds or tests, create another PR, or change PR metadata.

